<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">Haggai</book>
  <para style="h">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Haggai</para>
  <para style="mt">Haggai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leengpa Darius leenga apan kum, akum nina aha guhna, ani khat niin Juda gam uhpipa Shealtiel tapa Zerubbabel kungah leh siempu lienpen tapa Jehozadak tapa Joshua kungah guolnei Haggai akipat in Mangpa thu ahing tung hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Tambangin galkapte Mangpa’n agen hi: Tam miten Mangpa inn lam hun atung naisih achi uhi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuachi’n guolnei Haggai a kipat in Mangpa thu ahing tung a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Tami inn kisie a aum laitah a, noute inntung thuo ni neite a na ten hun uh ahiei mah? achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaziehin tuin galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Na umdan uh ngaituo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tampi natu ua, tomnoukhat na polut uhi; nane ua hinanleh na kham sih uh; na dawn ua hinanleh na gilva tuom sih uhi. Puon na sil ua hinanleh koima’n lum nasa tuom sih uh; sum nalaw ua, na lawsate uh ip tovanga guon dingin law na mu uhi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Na umdan uh ngaituo un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Muol ah kuontou unlen, sing va la unlen inn lam un, tuachi’n tuakhu ka kipahpi dinga tuachi’n pahtawi in ka um ding, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tampi mu ding na kinem ua hinanleh Ngai un, tawmnoukhat namu uhi, tualeh inn a na hing tut chiengun, ken kana semmang hi. Bangzieh ahiei? Galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi. Noute nouma inn lam chiet zuon in na kitai chiet ua, Kei inn asesa a a umden zieh ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaziehin na tung ua van in daitui ahentaanga, tualeh leitungin aga ahen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aziehpen Keima’n Gam leh muolte tung leh bu leh bal leh uoin tha leh sathau tungah, leitung gasuoh chinteng tungah, mihing leh ganta tungah, tualeh na khut nasep gimna zousie tungah, khokhalna ka tun sah ahi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuachi’n Shealtiel tapa Zerubbabel leh siempu lienpen Jehozadak tapa Joshua leh mipi umsunte zousie in Mangpa a Pasian uh aw leh Mangpa a Pasian un asawl mabangin guolnei Haggai thu amang ua, tualeh mipiten Mangpa azau mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa thupopa Haggai in Mangpa thuvaihah khu mipite kungah agen a, “Na kung uah ka um hi” Mangpa’n achi hi, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Mangpa’n Juda gam uhpipa Shealtiel tapa Zerubbabel lungsim, leh siempulienpen Jehozadak tapa Joshua lungsim, tualeh mipi umsunte lungsim atohthou a, tualeh ahing kuon ua galkapte Mangpa a Pasian uh inn bawl in na asem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Darius leengpa vaihawm kum, akum nina, ahaguhna anisawm leh li ni in, inn alampanta uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aha sagina, ani sawmni leh khat niin guolnei Haggai akipat in Mangpa thu ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Juda gam uhpipa Shealtiel tapa Zerubbabel kungah, siempu lienpen Jehozadak tapa Joshua kungah tualeh mipi umsunte kungah tuin thu gen in, achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nidanglai a tami inn thupina mu noute lah a adam nalai koi a um ei? Tualeh tuin tami bangchi na sa uoi? Amasa pen toh tekah in, na mitmu uah tam pen bangma ahisih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanleh tuin Aw Zerubbabel hattah in um in, tualeh siempulien pen Jehozadak tapa Joshua aw kisuhat in, tualeh nou gamsung a um mipite aw, hattah in um unlen nna sem un, Mangpa’n achi hi, aziehpen na kung uah ka um hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Noute Izipt gam akipat a, na hing peidoh lai ua na kung ua ka thuhunsa dungzuiin, ka hagau na lah uah a umden hi, zau sih un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: khat vei tah, sawt senglou ding ahi, van leh lei, tuipi leh gamgaw ka hotling ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tualeh namte zousie ka hotling ding a, namte zousie lunggul ahing tung dinga, tualeh thupina in tam inn ka dimsah ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Dangka kei a ahia, Sana zong kei a ahi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam inn nukhiazaw thupina khu inn masa pen thupina sangin athupi zaw ding hi, galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi. Tualeh tam mun ah hamuonna ka pe ding hi,” galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Darius vaihawm kum, akum nina, aha kuona, ani sawmni leh li ni in, guolnei Haggai akipat in Mangpa thu ahing tunga,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Galkapte Mangpa’n tambangin agen hi: Tuin dan tungtang thu, siempute dongun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi khat pou in a puonsil mongah sa sieng tuun in puo henlen, tua puon mong in tanghou ahiei, metuitah ahiei, zu ahiei, sathau ahiei, ahisihleh ann dang khat poupou ahiei, sukha taleh ann asukhah pen a siengthou sah diei?” achi hi. Tuachi’n siemputen adawng ua, “Siengthou lou,” achi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tualeh Haggai in: “Mi khatpou mishi luong zieh a bua khat in, tambang ann te khat pen pen zong sukha taleh tua ann asienglou ahi diei?” achi leh siemputen adawng ua, “He sienglou ding,” chiin adawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuachi’n Haggai in adawnga tambangin adawng hi, “Tam mite hichibang ahi ua, tam namte hichibangin ka mai ah a um hi, Mangpa’n achi hi, Tualeh akhut nasep chinteng u’zong hichibangma ahi a, asillat chingteng u’zong asienglou ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tualeh tuni apat maban lam ah, Mangpa inn a suong khat tung a suong dang akilep masangin pilvang tah in ngaituo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khum hunlai a tena ephah dimvum sawmni mu ding kinem a ahing pei u’leh, ephah sawm ana um hi, uoin suhna khuh a thawl sawm nga thal doh dinga ahing pei chieng un, sawmni ana um giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na khut nasepna zousie uh nget in ka nesah a, ka muot sah a tualeh giel in ka suse sah hi, hinanleh kei lam ah nang kihei tuom sih uhi, Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ha kuona ni sawmni leh li na, tuni akipat in maban hundongin, tumasang lam ngaituo un, Mangpa biehinn suongphum ni a kipat ngaituo un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tangsal sung ah buchi a um nalai ei mah? Ahi, tuni dongin grepgui ahiei, theipi kung ahiei, kawlbuthei ahiei leh Olive sing ahiei, aga nai sih hi. Hinanleh tuni akipat mailam hun ah noute ka hing guolzawl ding hi,” achi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tualeh tuami ha ani sawmni leh li niin Haggai akipat in Mangpa thu ahing tung a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Juda gam uhpipa Zerubbabel kungah thugen in: “Keima’n lei leh van ka hotling ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Leng gamte leengtoupha ka paikhe dinga, namte leenggam thahatnate ka suse ding hi. Kangtalaite leh atunga tuongte ka paikhe dinga, Sakolte leh atung ua tuongte ahing kumsuh ding ua, Michin asanggampa namsau a shi ding ahi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ni chiengin, Shealtiel tapa ka suohpa Zerubbabel aw, nang ka hing la ding; Mangpa’n achi hi, tualeh suoinamna khutsip bangin ka hing bawl ding hi, Mangpa’n achi hi. Aziehpen keiman nang ka hing telta hi,” galkapte Mangpa’n achi hi.
  </para>
</usx>
